PCL Aurora also adapts the following PCL-CE Lucide icon paths:

- PCL-CE: PCL.Core/UI/Assets/IconPacks/lucide/play.svg
- PCL-CE: PCL.Core/UI/Assets/IconPacks/lucide/download.svg
- PCL-CE: PCL.Core/UI/Assets/IconPacks/lucide/settings.svg
