  The applicable ISC and MIT license text is provided in LICENSES/Lucide-Icons.txt.

The original license texts are provided in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt,
LICENSES/PCL-CE-Plain-Craft-Launcher-2-LICENCE.txt and LICENSES/PCL2-LICENCE.txt.
Adapted source files identify their origin and modifications in file headers.
The Avalonia desktop shell and launch-page layout in
`src/PCL.Aurora.Desktop/Views/MainWindow.axaml` adapts the three PCL2 XAML
references listed above. It does not include the upstream WPF implementation;
Aurora retains its own bindings and cross-platform window behavior.
